   },
   "polycarpus.epistula-ad-philippenses": {
    "distinct_markers": 33,
    "low_accent_rows": 10
   }
  },
  "margin": "the corpus splits 33, 33, 7, then 2 distinct markers per work. That is a real gap, but MARKERS was built by reading Hermas and Polycarp, so it measures the marker list as well as the text: evidence that no fourth work is close, not proof that none exists."
 },
